# An allowlist, not a denylist (milestone 9 design D13): everything is excluded,
# and only what the image is built from is let back in. captures/, keys/,
# .env.dev, related-repos/, tests/ and .git cannot reach the build context by
# someone forgetting to list them here.
*
!src
!alembic
!alembic.ini
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock

# Nothing a developer's checkout grows inside the allowed directories either.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
